WEBVTT

00:15:28.858 --> 00:15:31.014
Ondje je, u srcu.

00:15:32.314 --> 00:15:35.188
Ovaj pogled, pogled panpsihista,

00:15:35.188 --> 00:15:38.489
ima potencijal za transformiranje 
našeg odnosa

00:15:38.489 --> 00:15:39.984
s prirodom,

00:15:39.984 --> 00:15:42.219
i možda ima neke ozbiljne društvene

00:15:42.219 --> 00:15:45.032
i etičke posljedice.

00:15:45.912 --> 00:15:48.071
Neke od ovih mogu biti kontraintuitivne.

00:15:48.071 --> 00:15:50.762
Nekad sam mislio da ne trebam jesti

00:15:50.762 --> 00:15:53.604
ništa što je svjesno,

00:15:53.604 --> 00:15:56.208
tako da sam bio vegetarijanac.

00:15:56.208 --> 00:15:58.775
Sad, ako ste panpsihist i gledate tako,

00:15:58.775 --> 00:16:01.505
bit ćete vrlo gladni.